<title>USA: Tracor completes $250 mln private placement.</title>
<headline>Tracor completes $250 mln private placement.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tracor Inc said on Monday it has completed its previously announced restructuring of its debt obligations, including a private placement of $250 million of 8-1/2 percent senior subordinated notes due 2007.</p>
<p>The proceeds are being used to reduce outstanding bank debt by $116 million and to purchase the company's currently outstanding 10-7/8 percent senior subordinated notes due 2001, the company said.</p>
<p>Tracor also said it has entered into a new $200 million revolving credit facility.</p>
</text>
